From sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov  Tue Sep 23 18:05:26 2008
From: sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov (Sean Davis)
Date: Tue, 23 Sep 2008 12:05:26 -0400
Subject: [BioC] How do you keep track of your analyses
In-Reply-To: <48D91085.2070708@icr.ac.uk>
